  ## 2. Plugin distribution

  ### 2.1 Manager mechanics [V]
  `plugin_getweb.m:51/53` fetches `http://sccn.ucsd.edu/eeglab/plugin_uploader/plugin_getcountall_nowiki_json.php?type=<type>&upload=<0|1>`; parsed fields: `name`(plugin), `downloads`(count), `version`(curversion), `zip`(link), `tags` (comma list e.g. `import`), `numrating`, `rating`, `critical`, `removed`, `size`, `webrating` URL (`simplestar.php?plugin=..&version=..`) [W+V]. `plugin_menu.m:128-137` filters `Filter by import|export|artifact|ica|preprocessing|erp|source|study|time-freq|other`; shows Tags/Status/Description + Install/Update [V]. `plugin_install.m` [W]: downloads zip, unzips into `fullfile(<eeglab>/plugins, [name version])`, pings `plugin_increment.php?plugin=<name>&version=<version>`; no validation of `eegplugin_*.m`. `plugin_askinstall(name, func, force)` is the programmatic installer (`plugin_askinstall('Fileio','ft_read_data')`). So the zip must unpack with `eegplugin_<x>.m` at top of `plugins/<name><version>/` (eeglab.m only searches one sub-folder level, 1050).

